## Conventions

- `src/index.ts` MUST call `initTracing()` BEFORE any other import.
- Config via `@cad/config` + a Zod schema. No `process.env.X` reads outside `src/config.ts`.
- Events through `@cad/events` so the envelope, validation, and OTel context propagation come for free.
- One Postgres schema, owned by this service. No cross-schema joins — call the owner's gRPC API or consume its events.

See `.claude/skills/new-service`, `.claude/skills/otel-trace`, `.claude/skills/nats-event`.
